In the middle of the screen.
 
Away from everything else on the screen.
 
In parentheses.
 
Capital letters.
 
Quotated.
 
Read the following words:  "Kid, have you rehabilitated yourself?"
 
I went over to the Commissar, said "Commissar, you got a lotta damn
